+@dataclass
+class Reservation:
+    """A temporary hold on stock for a cart, taken before payment.
+
+    An ACTIVE hold makes its units unavailable to anyone else until it is
+    confirmed into an order, released, or reaches ``expires_at``. ``items`` is
+    what was actually held, which may be less than what was requested.
